# Fetch the list, lab-mail's INBOX, into ~/mail/lists.
#
# lab-mail serves it on loopback and accepts any login, so the
# credentials here are placeholders.

IMAPAccount lab-mail
Host 127.0.0.1
Port 2143
TLSType None
AuthMechs LOGIN
User claude
Pass lab-mail

IMAPStore lab-mail
Account lab-mail

MaildirStore local
Path ~/mail/

Channel lists
Far :lab-mail:INBOX
Near :local:lists
Create Near
Sync Pull
Expunge None
Remove None
